<ttl id="1002J_S000U_744TG_T0089" variety="T0089">
<name>ABS with EBD &amp; TRC &amp; VSC &amp; BA System</name>
<para id="RM00000060P014X" category="C" type-id="300AA" name-id="442OP-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>C1249/49</dtccode>
<dtcname>Stop Switch Open Detection</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000060P014X_29" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A3L00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The skid control computer (built into the actuator) receives the stop light switch signal to detect the brake operation status.</ptxt>
<ptxt>The skid control computer has an internal open circuit detection circuit, and outputs this code if it detects an open in the stop light signal input line.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.22in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.86in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Output Related Items</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C1249/49</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>With IG1 terminal voltage at 9.5V or higher, an open in the stop light circuit (between A ←→ B or A ←→ body ground) continues for 0.3 seconds or more</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Open in wire harness between stop light circuit and actuator</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Poor connector contact pressure, terminal deformation or corrosion</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Actuator assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000060P014X_30" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A3M00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C159147J01" width="7.106578999in" height="4.7836529in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000060P014X_31" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000060P014X_32" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM00000060P014X_32_0172" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A3N00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Fuse (STOP 10A)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance of the fuse (STOP 10A).</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>STOP Fuse</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000060P014X_32_0173" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000060P014X_32_0178" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060P014X_32_0173" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A3O00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Stop Light Illumination</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON, depress the brake pedal, and check that the stop lights come on.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Comes on</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000060P014X_32_0174" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000060P014X_32_0179" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060P014X_32_0174" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A3P00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Actuator Assembly - Stop Light Switch Assembly)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG OFF and disconnect the actuator assembly and stop light switch assembly connectors.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that the connector case and terminals are free of deformation and corrosion.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No deformation or corrosion</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance of the wire harness side connectors between the actuator assembly and stop light switch assembly.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C160327J01" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.41in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.81in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="0.91in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>2(STP) - 1</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000060P014X_32_0175" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000060P014X_32_0180" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060P014X_32_0175" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A3Q00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (GND1, GND2)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG OFF and disconnect the actuator assembly connector.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C154597J03" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the wire harness side connector of the actuator assembly and body ground.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.14in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.88in"/>
